codemap 8
path map-file
kind type
author ai
group map
note The map itself: the only thing this tool persists. A directory, .codemap, at the root, committed with the code, with one text file per path holding its kind, group, note, author and steps. The format is hand-rolled, one field per line, no serialization dependency and no JSON. It exists to merge: two branches that change different paths touch different files, and two that change one path touch different lines unless they edit the same field of the same step. A file written by another version is refused outright and the map regenerated.

