note The reader, shared by the files on disk and the text jj or git hands back for a revision, which is several files one after another. Each codemap line starts a path. Steps are sorted by order, ties by id, and parent ids turned into indices; a parent that is not a step of the path fails the read. Steps come back stale; resolving them against the index clears it.

